<title>USA: Newport says board oks repurchase.</title>
<headline>Newport says board oks repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newport Corp said its board of directors has authorized a program for the repurchase of up to 90,000 shares, or 1.0 percent of Newport's outstanding common stock, to be used for employer equity compensation plans and an employee stock purchase plan.</p>
<p>The program will be put into effect immediately.</p>
</text>
